  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowerment of Women and Adolescent Girls ABAAD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ABAAD, as a resource centre, will play a key role in building the local capacity of GBV actors and protection stakeholders to change harmful norms and empower women and adolescent girls to be actors for change and to increase their resilience. The work will include capacity strengthening, the development of contextual tools, and advocacy. Advocacy efforts by ABAAD at the national level prioritise GBV, women&apos;s empowerment, and changing harmful norms and practices.</narrative>
  </description>
